# Live flight listings on the ticket. Optional — leave it unset and the panel
# shows the modelled fare and plain search links, which is the default and the
# only thing anyone cloning this repo will get.
#
# It points at the serverless function in the portfolio repo (api/flights.js),
# which holds the SerpApi key. The key is never here: this is a static bundle
# and Vite inlines VITE_* values into readable page source.
#
#   local, against the deployed function:
#     VITE_FLIGHTS_API=https://joseph-nguyen-portfolio.vercel.app/api/flights
#
#   local, against anything serving the same JSON shape — handy for working on
#   the list without spending quota. See src/lib/liveFlights.test.ts for the
#   shape; a static file works because the query string is simply ignored:
#     VITE_FLIGHTS_API=/some-fixture.json
VITE_FLIGHTS_API=
